SUMMARY:Dragon's Lair
UID:227380
DESCRIPTION:https://store.steampowered.com/app/227380\n\nHaven't heard of 
 Dragon's Lair?! Well\, you play the heroic Dirk the Daring\, a valiant 
 knight on a quest to rescue the fair princess from the clutches of an evil
  dragon! Originally released in the summer of 1983\, Dragon's Lair has 
 solidified itself as a cultural icon in gaming.\n\nDate string from steam:
  "2013-05-17"
LAST-MODIFIED:20261102T110242Z
DTSTAMP:20261102T110242Z
CATEGORIES:game_release
END:VEVENT
